---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BreachCostCalculator from '../../components/BreachCostCalculator';
---

<Layout title="Data Breach Cost Calculator" description="Estimate the financial impact of a cyberattack or data breach on your small business.">
  <div class="bg-slate-900 py-12 border-b border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        Data Breach Cost Calculator
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400">
        Small businesses often underestimate the true cost of a cyberattack. Use this tool to visualize the financial exposure of a data leak or ransomware attack.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 bg-slate-100 min-h-screen">
    <BreachCostCalculator client:load />

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-12 bg-white border border-slate-200 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">The Hidden Costs of a Breach</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
        When a small business gets hacked, the cost isn't just paying an IT guy to fix the computers. The financial damage comes from four major areas:
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-700 mb-6">
        <li><strong class="text-slate-900">1. Data Loss:</strong> If you lose customer data, you are legally required to notify them. You often have to pay for their credit monitoring for a year to avoid lawsuits.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-900">2. Downtime:</strong> A ransomware attack encrypts your files. If you can't access your inventory, scheduling, or payment systems, you are losing daily revenue until the system is rebuilt.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-900">3. Incident Response:</strong> Emergency IT forensics experts charge premium rates (often $300-$500/hour) to figure out how the hackers got in and ensure they are gone.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-900">4. Regulatory Fines:</strong> If you are in healthcare (HIPAA) or financial services, the government will fine you heavily for failing to protect consumer data.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-6">
        <a href="/tools/policy-generator" class="inline-flex items-center text-indigo-600 font-bold hover:text-indigo-800 transition-colors">
          Generate a Security Policy to protect your business
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
